  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "The greatest prime number that is a divisor of \\(16{,}384\\) is \\(2\\) because \\(16{,}384 = 2^{14}.\\) What is the sum of the digits of the greatest prime number that is a divisor of \\(16{,}383?\\)",
  "answerChoices": [
    {
      "label": "A",
      "text": "\\( 3 \\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "B",
      "text": "\\( 7 \\)"
    },
    {
      "label": "C",
      "text": "\\( 10 \\)"
    },
    {
